<view class="page"><view wx:if="error" class="error">{{error}}</view><block wx:if="order"><view class="card state-card"><view class="heading">{{order.label}}</view><view class="sub" wx:if="order.status==='UNPAID'">请在 {{order.expires}} 前完成付款，超时自动取消。</view><view class="sub" wx:if="order.status==='PAID'">付款后 72 小时内需标记交付，否则自动退款。</view><view class="sub" wx:if="order.status==='DELIVERED'">检查教材后确认收货；未确认将在付款满 7 天检查结算条件。</view><view class="sub" wx:if="order.status==='SETTLING'">正在等待支付渠道确认，当前尚未确认到账。</view><view class="sub" wx:if="order.status==='SETTLED'">渠道已确认结算。后续售后可通过投诉入口人工协调。</view><view class="error" wx:if="order.disputed">存在待处理投诉，结算暂停。</view><view class="tag warn" wx:if="mode==='mock'">模拟交易，不涉及真实资金</view></view><view class="card"><view class="item"><image class="cover" src="{{order.image}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="item-content"><view class="title">{{order.snapshot.title}}</view><view class="price">¥{{order.yuan}}</view></view></view><view class="divider"/><view class="row"><text class="sub">订单编号</text><text class="time">{{order.id}}</text></view><view class="row"><text class="sub">下单时间</text><text class="time">{{order.time}}</text></view><view class="row" wx:if="order.paidAt"><text class="sub">付款时间</text><text class="time">{{order.paidTime}}</text></view><view class="row" wx:if="order.deliveredAt"><text class="sub">交付时间</text><text class="time">{{order.deliveredTime}}</text></view><view class="row"><text class="sub">平台手续费</text><text class="time">0 元</text></view></view><view class="card" wx:if="order.refund"><view class="title">退款进度：{{order.refundLabel}}</view><view class="note">{{order.refund.reason}}</view><view class="note" wx:if="order.refund.reviewReason">审核说明：{{order.refund.reviewReason}}</view><button wx:if="isSeller&&order.refund.status==='WAIT_RETURN'" class="primary" bindtap="returned">确认已收到退书</button></view><view class="card" wx:if="order.settlement"><view class="title">结算进度：{{order.settlementLabel}}</view><view class="note">{{order.settlement.status==='SUCCEEDED'?'支付渠道已确认成功':'尚在处理中，不代表已到账'}}</view></view><view class="btn-row"><button wx:if="isBuyer&&order.status==='UNPAID'" class="secondary" data-action="cancel" bindtap="action" disabled="{{busy}}">取消订单</button><button wx:if="isBuyer&&order.status==='UNPAID'" class="primary" bindtap="pay" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">{{mode==='mock'?'模拟付款':'微信支付'}}</button><button wx:if="isSeller&&order.status==='PAID'" class="primary" data-action="deliver" bindtap="action" disabled="{{busy}}">标记已交付</button><button wx:if="isBuyer&&order.status==='DELIVERED'&&!order.disputed" class="primary" data-action="confirm" bindtap="action" disabled="{{busy}}">确认收货</button></view><view class="card refund-card" wx:if="isBuyer&&(order.status==='PAID'||order.status==='DELIVERED')"><view class="title">遇到交易问题？</view><view class="note">结算前可申请整单退款，提交后暂停结算，由管理员审核。</view><textarea class="input textarea" placeholder="填写未收到、版本不符等具体原因" maxlength="1000" value="{{reason}}" bindinput="reason"/><button class="secondary" bindtap="refund" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">申请全额退款</button></view><view class="btn-row"><button class="secondary" bindtap="chat">联系交易对方</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="complain">投诉与协调</button></view></block></view>
